Acidic corpses work too, and I have often seen monsters fix stoning that
way (not much use to the player though); I think I have seen monsters
use a potion of acid too, although it's rare since they usually throw
them on sight. I have not actually had to use a potion of acid that way
myself, but then again I can't remember the last time I had to use a
lizard corpse either (despite my walking around every 'trice in the game
so I can collect them for corpses on the ascension run).

Potion of acid is a nuisance for this though, and you need a lizard
corpse on standby too, since you have to put the potion away when
passing fire traps or pyrolisks. (Well, unless you have a spare, which I
did not.)

